# Keep the Docker build context small and free of secrets.
# Anything listed here is never sent to the Docker build, so it can never end up in an image.

# Secrets and local configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
apps/api/src/generated

# Not needed to build the API
.git
.github
.claude
docs
infra/*
!infra/migrate
apps/web
**/*.log
**/*.md
